  "bio": "Rod Muniz is an exceptionally skilled tattoo artist residing in Almada, Portugal. Known for his fineline and minimalist styles, Muniz carries an impressive background that includes a master's in drawing, showcasing his top-tier talent and commitment to the fine arts. As the head at Covenant Lisboa, you can book him through a direct message or via the provided link.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Almada, Portugal"
